{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure. The key insight: \"the award itself was originally created in the 2000s.\" The International Booker Prize was established in 2005. Let me think about the timeline:\n\n- Book A published in the 2010s, was a contender for the International Booker Prize, translated into 25+ languages\n- In the year Book A was published, Book B won the International Booker Prize\n- Book B was released the preceding year\n- Author of Book B born in city where Author of Book A grew up\n\nLet me look at the International Booker Prize winners in the 2010s and check the timeline. The 2017 winner was \"The Unseen\" by Roy Jacobsen. Let me search for books translated into 25+ languages that were contenders.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize 2017 winner The Unseen Roy Jacobsen\", \"International Booker Prize winners list 2010s by year\", \"Man Booker International Prize 2016 2017 2018 winner\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_cb1dd0f0d99a4ffa95447f3b","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"novel published 2017 translated 25 languages International Booker Prize shortlist\", \"book translated over 25 languages published 2017 award contender\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_45f64553583b4de7972612ad","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789479286,"id":"chatcmpl-64d9885b-1e28-90d3-b2e3-35670db89b5b","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20192,"completion_tokens":268,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20460,"cached_tokens":11264,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":11264},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}